{"availability":"available","full":"moff05/career-dashboard","name":"career-dashboard","description":"AI-powered job tracker — import any posting for an in-depth AI fit score, plus a coach that knows your background. Built with Next.js, Claude, and Turso.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-24T16:52:58Z","updated":"2026-10-06T16:42:36Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://career-dashboard-ten.vercel.app","topics":["anthropic","claude-ai","job-search","nextjs","turso","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://career-dashboard-ten.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:21:44.211Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:21:44.211Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:21:44.211Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:26.478Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:21:44.211Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A job tracker built to feel like a great spreadsheet, with two AI features that actually earn their place: import any job posting and get an in-depth AI fit score, and a coach that knows your background. Black canvas, one orange accent, monospace type — looks like a terminal, operates like consumer software; there's no command input anywhere. Built with Next.js, TypeScript, and Groq.","Note: Multi-user, no accounts, no API key required. A 3-step setup flow (resume → identity → background) creates a local identity stored in your browser; every visitor gets their own scoped data. AI runs server-side on a shared key — there's nothing to bring or configure. A persistent account key (shown in Profile) recovers your data on any other browser or device.","Live: career-dashboard-ten.vercel.app — visit and run through setup to start tracking with your own data. Already have an account? Enter your account key on the landing page to pick up where you left off on any device."],"features":["One page, plus two summonable overlays — no sidebar, no separate nav destinations for Coach or Profile.","Import a job posting from a URL, paste the job description directly with no link at all, or both — handles JS-rendered pages via Jina reader, and a multi-source pass (extra text, a second link, a screenshot) feeds one…","A free Priorities strip up top — deadlines, stale follow-ups, and interview prep, ranked by urgency then by fit score, no AI call. Clicking one expands and scrolls to the matching row instead of navigating anywhere","Company-grouped rows with collapsible expand, inline status updates, column sorting, and search/filter","AI match scorecard (5 categories, weighted to 100) auto-fires on panel open, cached per session — this is the core AI feature the tracker is built around"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/moff05/career-dashboard/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a97432f55c98be7dd3f64a07c0a3b658b26515c2115cc9231125c6cb489a54c9","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:26.575Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:26.575Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A job tracker built to feel like a great spreadsheet, with two AI features that actually earn their place: import any job posting and get an in-depth AI fit score, and a coach that knows your background. Black canvas, one orange accent, monospace type — looks like a terminal, operates like consumer software; there's no command input anywhere. Built with Next.js, TypeScript, and Groq.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/moff05/career-dashboard/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"> Note: Multi-user, no accounts, no API key required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/moff05/career-dashboard/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"> Note: Multi-user, no accounts, no API key required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/moff05/career-dashboard/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"a97432f55c98be7dd3f64a07c0a3b658b